  / 8e7c5232f64bee83d628679f930c771e4e49f2f1e37d19e41e0d7838e31f982e (9236 B)  /
  / is NOT a stale pin on this file: it is the output of the frozen legacy     /
  / pair the encoder proof runs against, and it MUST NOT be re-pinned to this  /
  / .diag as this .diag moves. A proof re-pointed at HEAD asserts only that    /
  / today's source produces today's output.                                    /

